    "title": "Manatee High to celebrate 2026 hall of fame class",
    "text": "LOCAL\nManatee High to celebrate 2026 hall of fame class\nVin Mannix\nSpecial to the Herald-Tribune\nSept. 27, 2026, 5:30 a.m. ET\nBig ups to the Manatee High Athletic Hall of Honor’s 2026 inductees to be celebrated Thursday at 6 p.m. at the Bradenton Country Club.\nThey are Wayne Dimond (Class of 1965), football; Van O’Quinn (’65), football; Mike Wortman (’79), football, baseball; Beth McIntosh (’83), softball); Hunter West (’02), soccer; Coach George Strouse Sr., track; and Bob Bowling (’66), Lifetime Achievement, football, baseball.",
    "summary": "Manatee High to celebrate 2026 hall of fame class Sept. 27, 2026, 5:30 a.m. ET Big ups to the Manatee High Athletic Hall of Honor’s 2026 inductees to be celebrated Thursday at 6 p.m. at the Bradenton Country Club. They are Wayne Dimond (Class of 1965), football; Van O’Quinn (’65), football; Mike Wortman (’79), football, baseball; Beth McIntosh (’83), softball); Hunter West (’02), soccer; Coach George Strouse Sr., track; and Bob Bowling (’66), Lifetime Achievement, football, baseball.",
